# A turn rozu cancels: a chunk, then rozu's session/cancel; Grok ends the prompt `cancelled`.
< session/prompt
> {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"sess-0001","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"Working on it"}}}}
< session/cancel
> {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":__ID__,"result":{"stopReason":"cancelled"}}
